    "method": "Authored public Conic inputs, real owned-window mouse motion acknowledged by a managed Rhino SDK OnEndMouseMove override, owned physical edge clicks, exact NURBS/segment and high-accuracy length queries, EndCommand success, source CRCs, and actual Undo/Redo. No Cancel tail, unknown command, invalid input, timeout or incomplete input in qualifying records. Source checks compare the inserted document geometry with its pre-command CRC, accounting for Rhino storing surfaces in B-rep containers. No proprietary implementation inspected or decompiled.",
    "cohort_note": "Nineteen direction witnesses are retained from the first 28-workflow capture. Eight edge witnesses were freshly recaptured after correcting the authored surfaces to the documented V-major control layout. One strengthened length-clamp witness picks beyond the source endpoint. The final fixture uses those exact authored inputs and the final observation retains the selected native rows without changing their values."
